  "description": "Server-side Web Push for Rask: the browsers that subscribed, kept on the app's own database, and a send that reaches them — Push.Send(message) for everyone, .To(userId) for one person's devices — dropping subscriptions the push service says are gone. Signs VAPID (RFC 8292) and encrypts (RFC 8291 aes128gcm) with in-box System.Security.Cryptography, and maps the subscribe endpoints a WebAssembly client or SPA posts to. Push.Fake() for tests.",
